<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>KuthorX Blog II</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/</link><description>Recent content on KuthorX Blog II</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-kr</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>보름달</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/misc/full_moon/</link><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/misc/full_moon/</guid><description>Full Moon</description></item><item><title>워터 워킹 볼</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/misc/water_walking_ball/</link><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 23:45:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/misc/water_walking_ball/</guid><description>Water Walking Ball</description></item><item><title>2025/11/12</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/misc/20251112/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Nov 2025 23:45:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/misc/20251112/</guid><description>근황</description></item><item><title>“마지막 사건” 게임 소개</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/thinking-talking/the-last-case/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/thinking-talking/the-last-case/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="이야기-소개"&gt;이야기 소개&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;한때 위대한 탐정이었던 &#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/posts/fiction/sad-slow-song/"&gt;프센 월&lt;/a&gt;&#10;은 생의 마지막 순간에 &#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/story_of_cloak/characters/d-xxxx/"&gt;죽은 코끼리&lt;/a&gt;&#10;를 통해 자신의 생명을 &#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/story_of_cloak/characters/k-1647/"&gt;K-1647&lt;/a&gt;&#10;에게 맡겼습니다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;K-1647의 의식은 월과 끊임없이 융합되어 자신을 &#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/story_of_cloak/characters/k-1647/"&gt;망토&lt;/a&gt;&#10;, &#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/story_of_cloak/characters/s-6458"&gt;화염 발톱&lt;/a&gt;&#10;, &#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/story_of_cloak/characters/a-4597"&gt;귀물고기&lt;/a&gt;&#10;로 분열시켰고, &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;투영기&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;를 통해 서로 다른 &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;차원&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;으로 투영했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;차원 0 《Story of Cloak》 (스토리 라인 0x00 - 0x0F)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;세 인물이 처음 만나는 곳&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;차원 A 《창록의 눈》 (스토리 라인 0xA0 - 0xAF)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;시공간이 혼란스럽고 퍼즐 요소로 가득합니다.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;대부분의 트릭은 소리/색과 관련되어 있어, 플레이어는 시간 스펙트럼 Spectrogram과 광 스펙트럼 OpticalSpectrum의 매핑으로 퍼즐을 풀어야 합니다.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;11개의 사건이 예정되어 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;차원 B 《케이틀린 월의 마지막 사건》 (스토리 라인 0xB0 - 0xBF)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>“청록빛 눈” 편집자 주</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/thinking-talking/thats-it/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 20:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/thinking-talking/thats-it/</guid><description>The show must go on</description></item><item><title>다시 한 번의 경계 1 / 2</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/thinking-talking/after-read-deconstruction/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Jun 2024 02:15:02 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/thinking-talking/after-read-deconstruction/</guid><description>Deconstruction</description></item><item><title>긴 이별</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/fiction/long-goodbye/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 May 2024 00:00:01 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/fiction/long-goodbye/</guid><description>Long Goodbye</description></item><item><title>“연회는 멈출 수 없다”에서 시작해</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/ko/posts/thinking-talking/talk-from-john